      "cooked": "<p>I recently noticed that the corner and sides of my cards were starting to get slightly beat-up since I do not sleeve them.</p><p>So I decided to get some may-day premium green sleeves that are exactly 63.5*88.</p><p>They fit my IR and RC expansion cards perfectly. But for my EE the cards they were slightly sticking out of those sleeves.</p><p>Anyone else have this issue?</p><p>Mine was the 2nd Edition of EE. First Edition of RC. Don't remember IR.</p>",
