      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-02-04T22:14:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"VanceAttack\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/v/977dab/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> VanceAttack:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This is a printing issue with some of the enhanced editions for Tachyon, Ra, and Tempest. Contact &gt;G and they will hook you up with some fixes.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Actually, all the cards are the same height.&nbsp; They just are a bit taller than advertised (mine have a similar problem).&nbsp; A friend of mine had the Tachyon/Ra/Tempest misprint, and it is a different concern than what the OP was talking about.&nbsp; While the mis-sized Tachyon/Ra/Tempest decks are a straight up misprint, the taller EE cards seem to be something that happened on pretty much all of the EE cards (as far as I am aware).</p>",
