      "created_at": "2013-02-05T07:19:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Reckless\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/48/2467_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Reckless:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>…the taller EE cards seem to be something that happened on pretty much all of the EE cards (as far as I am aware).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes this is the issue I have.</p>\n<p>So anyone have suggestion on how they sleeve or would you suggest sleeving them with just the top sticking out? Thanks for response in advance.</p>",
