      "raw": "<p>It&#39;s a rather difficult situation for the sleeve-minded Sentinel.&nbsp; Sleeves that stick over the top make the cards too large to fit in the box horizontally, and card sleeves that fit in the box are too small for the cards.&nbsp; Sadly, you may just have to buy premium standard sleeves and trim the excess off by hand if you want sleeves that fit the cards and the box, which doesn&#39;t sound like fun.&nbsp; I&#39;m probably just going to buy premium Mayday sleeves and do my best to treat that little overhang with care.</p>",
